# Responsive Rules

## Breakpoint map (Tailwind defaults + Suricat)

| Token | Width | Suricat use |
|-------|-------|-------------|
| `sm` | 640px | Padding / type steps |
| `md` | 768px | 2-col footers / stacks |
| `lg` | 1024px | Nav height `lg:h-24`, section type |
| `xl` | 1280px | Desktop nav (`hidden xl:flex`), logo tight fit |
| `nav` / `min-[1377px]` | 1377px | Nav gaps, type, CTA pad density |
| `2xl` | 1536px | Max nav density |

## Nav behavior

- Mobile: hamburger; desktop menu from `xl` (1280), not `lg`
- Heights: `h-16` → `lg:h-24`
- Logo heights scale at `sm` / `xl` / `min-[1377px]` (match Designs CSS)
- Preserve special laptop query when porting index/contact home sections:
  `@media (min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1376px) and (max-height: 800px)`

## Type scale steps (canonical)

```text
Hero H1:     text-2xl … lg:text-[36px] leading-[44px]   (home may use text-4xl lg:text-[36px])
Section H2:  text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[28px] leading-tight lg:leading-[36px]
Hero sub:    text-base lg:text-[22px] leading-[32px]
Section body: text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-[20px] leading-relaxed lg:leading-[28px]
```

## Bug fix when porting

Many Designs headings use `sm:text-sm` — that is wrong. Use `sm:text-3xl` for section H2.

## Testing bar

Every page must look correct at: ~375, 768, 1024, 1280, 1377, 1536+.
No horizontal scroll (`overflow-x: clip` on `html`).
